# KNOWN-DEFECT: NetfilterExport.php:39 binds $attribute in the loop but then reads $data['Attribute']['type'] - the LIST - so every iteration raises 'Undefined array key type' and no rules are emitted. Fix proposed upstream: MISP/MISP#10965.
# This records current behaviour so refactors are still detected.
# It is NOT the intended contract. Fixing the defect should produce
# exactly one diff here plus a specification test flipping to passing.
